cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this data, please cite it as below."
title: "SMA Research — Open Drug Discovery Catalog"
abstract: >-
  Open-source computational drug discovery data and findings for
  Spinal Muscular Atrophy (SMA). Includes molecular dynamics
  trajectories, docking results, ADMET profiles, selective
  kinase-inhibitor campaigns, SMN2 base-editing guide designs,
  and AAV capsid engineering. All artifacts are released under
  CC-BY-4.0 to enable reproduction and extension by other groups.
type: dataset
